{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHKの歌コン見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松本伊代さんと後半のセンチメンタルジャーニーと早見優さんと夏色のナンシーをコラボでやらせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な時間を有難うございます。凄く凄く嬉しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして気づいたら片思いも披露しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲の衣装も凄く好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみと手遊びして遊んでました( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蝶々つくったり犬つくったり、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみと、お揃いのスニーカーを買う約束したよ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングヘアにしました〜^o^"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の握手会ではポリスのコスプレをしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれてありがとう〜^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違えて一週間早くコスプレしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場ついたらみんな私服で恥ずかしかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目元のメイクもハロウィン使用\nゴールドを二重幅に入れたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短すぎなんだよね...スカートが...生で見られるのは恥ずかしかったので写真で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´◒`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て気づいたかな？コスプレということで髪の毛もロングです٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °気分転換に❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポリスって言い続けたんだけど、この服胸元に空軍って英語で書いてあるらしくて、、、\n何人かの方には握手中気づかれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポリスだと思って買ったからポリスって言い続けた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいNEWS聞いてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と ひめちゃんと広島の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（ びっくり！ 広島）のスペシャルサポーターをさせていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京と広島の学生の方のアイデアを待っています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって広島のお仕事が出来るのはとっても幸せです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくれるみんなのおかげなんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃん！お誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんはいつもお泊まり会やディズニーそしてお祭りとか！何かあるときはいつも誘ってくれて本当に有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日が学校だったりでなかなか行けないけど誘ってくれることが本当に嬉しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも楽しいこと沢山しようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌やダンス、お芝居と多彩なあみちゃん！尊敬してるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきっ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になりますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてななみん！卒業発表しましたね。。\nなんとな〜く感じてたけど本人の口から聞いたときはやっぱりびっくりしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいが発表した時は、まだ時間はあるからたくさん思い出作って行こーって思ってたら、あっという間に時間は過ぎちゃったから、ななみんとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと一緒に過ごせる時間を大切にしよーって思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんが幸せなのが私達の幸せなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しい気持ちと、幸せを願う気持ちと、、大きな存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんとは食が合うのでご飯にいきたいなっ(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャン！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋刀魚！！！！\nお魚さんを綺麗に食べるのが得意なんです( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今が旬のさんまを炭火焼してあるのを食べたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/10/28/1153033/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん！！\n明るくて可愛い きいちゃん、声も可愛くて同郷のひめちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは揚げ足をとる大好きな まいちゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜おめでとう〜‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんのフロントもすっごく嬉しかったよ〜(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本武道館ライブも決まったし嬉しいな٩(๑˃̵ᴗ˂̵๑)۶ °まあやも頑張るぞー\nbye"}],"source":"archive"}